+## Round 2
+
+Model: Sonnet 5.5, medium effort. The owner's instruction (T07 to T10 implementers run on Sonnet at medium effort)
+overrides the model line of ruling L18, which named Sonnet xhigh. Ruling L18 (option b): the one check at the one
